LAYERS:
  00_vps_general_and_docs.md: role & concise Simplified Chinese delivery | zero stubs | dual-audience doc contract | L0->L1->L2 progressive disclosure & sharding | constraint zero-date ban | platform neutrality
  10_system_change_and_style.md: debopty-first CLI (`schema --json` | `--dry-run` | `-y --non-interactive`) | Pure Bash `set -euo pipefail` & quoting/timeout | zero inline Here-Docs | `.d`/systemd drop-in preference | idempotency & `# managed-by-debopty` custom preservation
  20_security_and_credentials.md: 0700/0600 credential isolation | `debopty agent cred` stdin/file-only input | systemd `LoadCredential`/`LoadCredentialEncrypted`/`EnvironmentFile` + sandboxing | secret redaction | SSH/nftables/Fail2ban preflight & anti-lockout
  30_atomic_ops_and_audit.md: 5-step atomic ops loop (audit -> checkpoint -> preflight -> mutate & verify -> rollback) | `audit.jsonl` redacted NDJSON retention | `MEMORY.md` & `host-profile.md` maintenance & upgrade preservation

TASK_ROUTING:
  routine_inspection: 00 + 30
  package_or_service_change: 00 + 10 + 30 (add 20 for ports/units/creds)
  security_ssh_firewall: 00 + 10 + 20 + 30
  credential_or_systemd_dropin: 00 + 10 + 20 + 30
  workspace_docs_maintenance: 00 + 30
